TITLE  Simple x-ray generator, detector and filter.
       .
       >>>>>>>> Source definition.
SKPAR  1        [Primary particles: 1=electron, 2=photon, 3=positron]
SENERG 2.8e4            [Initial energy (monoenergetic sources only)]
SPOSIT -5. 0 0                            [Coordinates of the source]
SCONE  90 0 0                           [Conical beam; angles in deg]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Material data and simulation parameters.
MFNAME W.mat                          [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e3 1e3 1e3 0.05 0.05 1e3 1e3        [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MFNAME Al.mat                         [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e3 1e3 1e3 0.05 0.05 1e3 1e3        [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MFNAME Si.mat                         [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e3 1e3 1e3 0.05 0.05 1e3 1e3        [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Geometry and local simulation parameters.
GEOMFN tube.geo                       [Geometry file, up to 20 chars]
DSMAX  1 2e-2                    [KB, maximum step length in body KB]
EABSB  1 1e3 1e3 1e3      [KB, local absorption energies, EABSB(1:3)]
EABSB  2 1e3 1e3 1e3      [KB, local absorption energies, EABSB(1:3)]
EABSB  3 1e3 1e3 1e3      [KB, local absorption energies, EABSB(1:3)]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Interaction forcing.
IFORCE 1 1 4  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 1 1 5  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 2 1 4  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 2 1 5  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 3 1 4  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
IFORCE 3 1 5  400    0.1 2.0          [KB,KPAR,ICOL,FORCER,WLOW,WHIG]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Bremsstrahlung splitting.
IBRSPL 1 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
IBRSPL 2 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
IBRSPL 3 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
       .
       >>>>>>>> X-ray splitting.
IXRSPL 1 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
IXRSPL 2 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
IXRSPL 3 4                                      [KB,splitting factor]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Emerging particles. Energy and angular distributions.
NBE    0 3e4 150                    [Energy window and no. of bins]
NBANGL 90 45               [No. of bins for the angles THETA and PHI]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Impact detectors (up to 5 different detectors).
       IPSF=0; no psf is created.
       IPSF=1; a psf is created (for only one detector).
       IDCUT=0; tracking is discontinued at the detector entrance.
       IDCUT=1; the detector does not affect the tracking.
       IDCUT=2; the detector does not affect tracking, the energy
                distribution of particle fluence (integrated over the
                volume of the detector) is calculated.
IMPDET 0. 3e4 150 0 2          [E-window, no. of bins, IPSF, IDCUT]
IDAGEL 1e-11 1e-8 -500                 [Age interval and no. of bins]
IDBODY 2                                                [Active body]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Impact detectors (up to 5 different detectors).
IMPDET 0. 3e4 150 0 0          [E-window, no. of bins, IPSF, IDCUT]
IDAGEL 1e-11 1e-8 -500                 [Age interval and no. of bins]
IDBODY 3                                                [Active body]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Job properties.
RESUME dump.dmp                [Resume from this dump file, 20 chars]
DUMPTO dump.dmp                   [Generate this dump file, 20 chars]
DUMPP  60                                    [Dumping period, in sec]
       .
NSIMSH 2e9                      [Desired number of simulated showers]
TIME   2e9                         [Allotted simulation time, in sec]
